{%- comment -%}
  Free-shipping nudge under the buy box (Sept 2026 audit).
  Product-page accelerated checkout buys this variant without the existing
  cart, so the claim is based on the selected variant alone. When it is below
  the threshold, the copy directs shoppers to Add to cart to combine items.
  Renders nothing when the threshold is 0. Accepts: variant.
  Server-rendered from the first available variant; the drawer's live bar
  remains the source of truth once the item is in the cart.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign nudge_threshold = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100
  assign nudge_remaining = 0
  if nudge_threshold > 0 and variant != blank
    assign nudge_remaining = nudge_threshold | minus: variant.price
  endif
-%}
{%- if nudge_threshold > 0 and variant != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    data-threshold lets global.js recompute the line when the shopper picks a
    variant with a different price (Codex review).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <p class="pdp__shipnudge" data-ship-nudge data-threshold="{{ nudge_threshold }}">
    <span data-ship-nudge-text>
      {%- if nudge_remaining > 0 -%}
        <strong>{{ nudge_remaining | money }} away from free US shipping.</strong> Add to cart to combine items.
      {%- else -%}
        <strong>Ships free in the US.</strong> This item clears the {{ nudge_threshold | money_without_trailing_zeros }} threshold.
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
